sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Weather as Weather Sensor AWS-04
    participant Loop as Induction Loop D-12
    participant Sampark as 181 Citizen Calls
    participant Ingest as Ingestion Adapters
    participant Engine as Intelligence Engine
    participant DB as DB / In-Memory Store
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant LLM as Grounded LLM Explainer
    participant UI as React Dashboard

    Weather->>Ingest: Raw Precipitation Payload (48.2 mm/h)
    Loop->>Ingest: Raw Speed Payload (6.4 km/h)
    Sampark->>Ingest: Raw Incident Count (38 calls)
    
    Ingest->>Engine: Normalized Observations Schema
    Engine->>Engine: Calculate Baselines & Detect Z-Score Anomalies
    Engine->>Engine: Spatial (Zone A) & Temporal Correlation (15m window)
    Engine->>Engine: Generate Civic Event (Concordance 89.4%)
    
    Engine->>DB: Store Civic Event & Update Zone State
    
    UI->>API: GET /api/events
    API->>DB: Query Active Events
    DB-->>API: Return Active Civic Event JSON
    API-->>UI: Civic Event Response
    
    UI->>API: POST /api/explain { event_id }
    API->>LLM: Generate Grounded Explanation (Evidence Input)
    LLM-->>API: Explanation Summary
    API-->>UI: Plain-Language Explanation Response
